    "CoiStatement": "There are no conflicts of interest. What is new? Previously reported mutations in KRT17 also occur in the Indian populationThe patient advocacy group, pachyonychia congenita (PC) project (www.pachyonychia.org) provides many services for PC patients worldwide including free genetic testingConfirmation of a clinical diagnosis allows for appropriate genetic counseling and management of the disorder.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "422-426"},
